  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Our greatest triumph...no, our greatest joy! At long last we have created the perfect servitor race. A blend of avian and reptilian traits, we've fortified them with non-carbon based cells. This should allow them to survive on the harsh outer rim worlds we are seeding with their genes.",
    "value": "我等最伟大的胜利...不，是我等最大的喜悦！我等终于创造了完美的仆从种族。结合鸟类与爬行动物的特征，我等用非碳基细胞强化了它们。这将使它们能在我们播种的恶劣外环星球上生存。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "They say we should name them, but I deemed that most unwise. At least, not until they have earned it. A fledgeling race still learning to be a species, these beings should provide us with the extra labor we require if the Generator is to be created in any decent period of time. With our physical bodies beginning to erode...time is precious.",
    "value": "有人提议为它们命名，但我认为，至少应在它们赢得命名资格之前这么做极不明智。这个初生的种族尚在学习成为真正的物种。若要在有限时间内建成发电机，这些生命体需为我等提供额外劳动力。我等的肉体正逐渐腐朽...时间宝贵。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "<this book appears to span centuries. There are countless entries about this unnamed species they created , but none that give anything useful until roughly 824 years after the first entry.> It was assumed they would retain their docile traits, as we specifically erased the capacity for anger and rage in the initial generations.",
    "value": "<此书似乎跨越数世纪。关于这一未命名物种的记载众多，但直到首条记录约824年后，才出现有价值的信息。>我等曾假定它们会保持温顺，因我们特意抹去了初代个体的愤怒能力。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "Nature, on the other hand, had other ideas. They are rising up and revolting now, refusing our commands and worse...they are angry about it. While still the ideal candidate species, they have been unable to facilitate our requirements for construction on the Generator. Recommend expunging genes through purge.",
    "value": "然而自然另有安排。它们如今奋起反抗，拒绝服从命令，更甚的是...它们为此愤怒。虽仍是理想候选物种，它们已无法满足发电机建设的需求。建议通过清洗清除基因。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "The purge has failed! Somehow, they have taken control of the command vessels. I suspect inusurrection, most likely from the Naturalist caste. They sympathize with the plight of the Servants. Why they would side with fuzzy flying...things...is beyond me. We have been forced out of the system, and command has instructed us to simply abandon it, leaving the servants to their own devices.",
    "value": "清洗行动失败！它们竟控制了指挥舰。我怀疑有叛乱行为，很可能来自自然主义者阶层，他们同情仆从的处境。为何要支持这些毛茸茸的飞行...生物...实难理解。我等已被逐出该星系，指挥部下令放弃此处，任仆从自生自灭。"
  }
]